      en: ["San is the primary center for rice production in the Bani River basin.", "The Great Mosque of San is built in the iconic Sudano-Sahelian mud style.", "The town is strategically located on the main Bamako-Mopti transport axis.", "The annual Sanké-mon collective fishing ritual is a major cultural event.", "Onions grown in the San region are exported across West Africa.", "The San plains irrigation scheme encompasses thousands of hectares."],
